OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Welsh Green Party deputy says
OL,4,AZionism motion 'pointless' after
OL,5,Aquitting party
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Green Party's former deputy leader
OL,8,Fin Wales says he resigned over the
OL,9,Fmotion to declare "Zionism is racism"
OL,10,Fbecause it was "pointless" and some of
OL,11,Fthe statements made were "disgraceful".
OL,13,FPhil Davies announced on social media
OL,14,Fon Tuesday his decision to quit the
OL,15,Fparty had been "accelerated" by
OL,16,FSunday's conference motion.
OL,18,FIn the post he had described the motion
OL,19,Fas "imperialistic" and "idiotic", and
OL,20,Fsaid Welsh Greens should consider
OL,21,Fsplitting away from the English part of
OL,22,Fthe party.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
