OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Welsh Green Party deputy says
OL,4,AZionism motion 'pointless' after
OL,5,Aquitting party
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn response party leader Zack Polanski
OL,8,Freissued a statement, originally sent
OL,9,Fon Monday, saying he would not accept
OL,10,Fanyone being excluded from the party
OL,11,F"because of the religious or communal
OL,12,Fbody they are part of".
